style
  ~  undercurl — SGR 4:3 wrapped around the glyph, plus Modifier::UNDERLINED
  _  Modifier::UNDERLINED alone (the degraded path)
  s  Modifier::CROSSED_OUT — a deprecated completion, which also recedes one step down §1's neutral ramp so a terminal that ignores SGR 9 still says so
